  ($q$cs-94$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Economist A argues that raising the minimum wage reduces employment at small businesses, citing a survey in which small business owners reported plans to cut staff.

