  ($q$cs-98$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Film archivist A argues that restorations should digitally remove scratches and color fading so viewers see the film as its original audience did on a pristine print.

